  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "分手的真相  (Asking for the Truth of the Breakup)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Having discovered inconsistencies in Luo Lin's story, pop diva Xin Huimei invites Chun Yuqiao to a quiet lounge to hear his side of their old breakup—and offers an apology if she wronged him. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于先生肯来赴约，很给面子呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有什么可以效劳的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "上次给你惹的麻烦，不介意吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛小姐这是要道歉吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "需要给一个渣男道歉吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "渣男也有被冒犯的时候啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我辛惠美做事向来我行我素，但是也从来不做糊涂事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们分手的真相，我在她那儿听说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "但是我还想在你嘴里得到证实。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "如果我有错，我会道歉的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我的私事没有必要告诉你，而且那儿不可能得到真相。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真的不喝一杯啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于先生肯来赴约，很给面子呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, coming to keep our appointment does me a great honour.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有什么可以效劳的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How may I be of service?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "上次给你惹的麻烦，不介意吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you not mind the trouble I caused you last time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛小姐这是要道歉吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you about to apologise, Miss Xin?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "需要给一个渣男道歉吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does anyone need to apologise to a cad?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "渣男也有被冒犯的时候啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even a cad has moments when he is wronged.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我辛惠美做事向来我行我素，但是也从来不做糊涂事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I, Xin Huimei, have always done things my own way, yet I never act muddle-headedly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们分手的真相，我在她那儿听说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard the truth about your breakup from her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "但是我还想在你嘴里得到证实。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, I want to hear it confirmed from your own lips.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "如果我有错，我会道歉的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I was in the wrong, I will apologise.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我的私事没有必要告诉你，而且那儿不可能得到真相。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no need to tell you my private affairs, and you will never get the truth from her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真的不喝一杯啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you really not have a glass?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not drink alcohol.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于先生肯来赴约，很给面子呀。",
      "gap": 0.5
